# Testing Conventions

## Framework

- Use Vitest with React Testing Library for frontend
- Mock external services using MSW, never make real API calls in tests

## Structure

- One test file per source file, named \_.test.ts
- Group tests with describe blocks by method or behavior
- Use arrange-act-assert pattern

## Examples to follow

- src/components/ui/button/button.test.tsx (good example of component tests)
